      <xs:documentation>Enumeration set for the Identity Document Type BDT. {codeListAgencyIdentifier}PADIS 7365{/codeListAgencyIdentifier} {codeListAgencyName}PADIS{/codeListAgencyName} </xs:documentation>
    </xs:annotation>
